    "homogeneous_state_obstruction": {
      "statement": "At the uniform phase all translated phase signatures coincide, so any distance-only relational graph rule is either empty below zero or complete at zero. Phase differentiation/localized orbit structure is therefore a prerequisite for this geometry source."
